{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27622","headline":"哭京兆庞尹 · 张祜","name":"哭京兆庞尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨子江头昔共迷，一爲京兆隔云泥。\n故人昨日同时吊，旧马今朝别处嘶。\n向壁愁眉无复画，扶牀稚齿已能啼。\n也知世路名堪贵，谁信庄周论物齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}